{
 "_note": "push/512: Mother of Echoes omen fixes (2026-11-08, director: 'Let's fix the unreliable omens'). (1) An Absence held The Absence Opens while Sayo carried cleanseprevent (her Refraction telegraph), so Opens landed up to 3 rounds after The Absence Settles had faded; the hold rule is removed, so it opens the turn after it settles. (2) Lucid Refraction drew new lines (visuals only) that never broke; it now lays Refraction's telegraph carrier on rows 1/4/7 plus increaserange on Sayo, so next turn Refraction Breaks fires on those lines (Lucid Refraction itself is on cooldown 2). (3) The Silence could cast Stillness and then drift closer in the same turn, so the ring no longer matched where Nothing Moves lands; a rule now ends her turn while she carries robprevent (Stillness's marker), placed before the move rule. Law 18: Sayo unequipped, Lucid Refraction edited, kit re-equipped by literal id (511 list). Hand-built from live records read 2026-11-08.",
